e that america  has in my heart made it even more you  know  horrible um and devastating to me  and watching the news what happened is  that my mother  the moment the second plane hit  she knew because as i had said she'd  been following you know all the events  leading up to that and she knew he  wasn't going to stop  but she never imagined it would  something like this or  of this magnitude nobody could compute  something like this  would happen but so the moment the  second plane hit  she knew that our name was going to be  linked right  so after the  the initial you know the first moments  where we were just  all grieving in front of the television  she you know  sat us down the three of us and told us  you know girls you know brace yourselves  because your life is never going to be  the same again  and a couple of hours later that's when  the name  started um started circulating  and well what she said uh happened  you know and did you go when did you go  to school next day and if you did how  did the teachers how did everybody react  when they saw you what did they say  um i went to school the next day and um  people knew how much i loved  uh america because of i was you know  quite well known in the school and quite  popular i was  one of the star athletes of the school  and they knew how much america you know  means to me and so they were very very  kind  they came to me asking me if i was okay  and um people were very kind to me the  next day and very lovely  wow that's great to hear powerful  because they knew your true beliefs now  what did your mom get her belief system  who who passed down  their belief system to your mom or did  she have an inspiration did she read a  book did she have somebody that inspired  her  well her mom you know the way she was  raised also by her  her mom and she i think set a great  example for her and  but my mom was also very rebellious from  my understanding also you know growing  up  and she always loved she always  loved 